Backport GitHub issue support for NEWS reading and merging to blurb 1.0.7.
Based on upstream commit a2e8eeca0c72343fb30e67aaf33a6f0c1db440b1:
https://github.com/python/blurb/commit/a2e8eeca0c72343fb30e67aaf33a6f0c1db440b1

Keep Python 3.6 and pip 18.1 support. Only the documentation build's private
copy is patched; the installed blurb package and NEWS fragments are unchanged.

